        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: White Nights (1985 film)\n- People: Taylor Hackford, Twyla Tharp, Mikhail Baryshnikov, Gregory Hines, Jerzy Skolimowski, Helen Mirren, Isabella Rossellini, Phil Collins, Marilyn Martin, Lionel Richie\n- Songs: Separate Lives, Say You, Say Me\n- Topics: film soundtrack\n\nFacts:\n- Gregory Hines was born on February 14, 1946, and he became an American dancer, actor, singer, and choreographer.\n- White Nights is a 1985 American drama film directed by Taylor Hackford and choreographed by Twyla Tharp.\n- White Nights stars Mikhail Baryshnikov, Gregory Hines, Jerzy Skolimowski, Helen Mirren, and Isabella Rossellini.\n- Separate Lives is a 1985 song recorded by Phil Collins and Marilyn Martin for the White Nights soundtrack.\n- Say You, Say Me is a song written and recorded by Lionel Richie for the film White Nights.\n- Gregory Hines died on August 9, 2003.",
